type":"Person","@id":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/#\/schema\/person\/87e55a5e8ea020a6e620192589a05abf","name":"KrakenFX","image":{"@type":"ImageObject","inLanguage":"en-US","@id":"https:\/\/secure.gravatar.com\/avatar\/376cf5127aff2ae0a43942a0566f9d379956601670650244112b4fdb4b8c31e3?s=96&d=identicon&r=g","url":"https:\/\/secure.gravatar.com\/avatar\/376cf5127aff2ae0a43942a0566f9d379956601670650244112b4fdb4b8c31e3?s=96&d=identicon&r=g","contentUrl":"https:\/\/secure.gravatar.com\/avatar\/376cf5127aff2ae0a43942a0566f9d379956601670650244112b4fdb4b8c31e3?s=96&d=identicon&r=g","caption":"KrakenFX"},"url":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/author\/alex-hatch"}]}},"jetpack_likes_enabled":false,"jetpack_sharing_enabled":true,"jetpack_shortlink":"https:\/\/wp.me\/peDd1v-7ty","jetpack_featured_media_url":"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/NewAsset_Blog-1.png?fit=3070%2C1400&ssl=1","_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/28740","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/230089386"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=28740"}],"version-history":[{"count":2,"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/28740\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":28743,"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/28740\/revisions\/28743"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/28742"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=28740"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"category","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/categories?post=28740"},{"taxonomy":"post_tag","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/tags?post=28740"},{"taxonomy":"language","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/language?post=28740"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}},{"id":28744,"date":"2025-06-11T09:25:33","date_gmt":"2025-06-11T13:25:33","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/?p=28744"},"modified":"2025-06-17T07:07:19","modified_gmt":"2025-06-17T11:07:19","slug":"keeping-our-platform-safe","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/news\/industry-news\/keeping-our-platform-safe","title":{"rendered":"Keeping our platform safe: How we protect against fraud and criminal activity"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">We are committed to maintaining the highest standards of trust, security and integrity. We do this to protect our clients while advancing our mission to accelerate the global adoption of crypto. We take our responsibility seriously, which is why preventing bad actors from using our platform is a key part of our efforts.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-our-approach-a-multi-layered-defense\"><strong>Our approach: A multi-layered defense<\/strong><\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">We take a proactive and rigorous approach to detecting and preventing fraud, money laundering and other illicit activity. Our systems are built to identify threats early and respond quickly.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Our risk detection and enforcement tools include:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Blockchain analytics to trace the flow of assets across networks<\/strong><strong><br><\/strong><\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Behavioral monitoring to identify unusual or high-risk account activity<\/strong><strong><br><\/strong><\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Pattern recognition systems to flag known indicators of fraud or scams<\/strong><strong><br><\/strong><\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Compliance controls aligned with FATF, FinCEN, FCA, and other global regulatory frameworks<\/strong><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-no-place-for-illicit-assets\"><strong>No place for illicit assets<\/strong><\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Kraken does not allow the use of its platform for any activity involving fraud, theft, scams, or other criminal behavior. Our <a href=\"https:\/\/www.kraken.com\/legal\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Terms of Service<\/a> prohibit depositing or withdrawing fiat or crypto that is suspected to originate from or support criminal behavior. Misusing our platform will not be tolerated.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-what-happens-when-suspicious-activity-is-detected\"><strong>What happens when suspicious activity is detected?<\/strong><\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">When suspicious activity is identified, Kraken acts immediately. Enforcement actions may include:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Freezing or closing accounts<\/strong><br><\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Restricting access to potentially illicit funds<\/strong><br><\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Reporting incidents to law enforcement, regulators and financial intelligence units<\/strong><br><\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Banning individuals from our platform permanently<\/strong><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">We also collaborate closely with global law enforcement and regulatory bodies to disrupt illicit financial flows and return stolen assets when possible.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-partnering-for-a-safer-ecosystem\"><strong>Partnering for a safer ecosystem<\/strong><\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Fraud prevention is a shared responsibility. That\u2019s why Kraken maintains close collaboration with regulatory bodies, law enforcement agencies and blockchain intelligence firms. Together, we work to strengthen industry standards and disrupt illegal activity across the crypto space.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">We also believe in empowering our clients to stay safe. Our <a href=\"https:\/\/www.kraken.com\/learn\/how-to-safely-send-receive-cryptocurrency\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Crypto Safety Guide<\/a> offers tips and resources to help users recognize threats and protect their assets.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">We encourage all clients to:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Stay vigilant and report any suspicious activity through our <a href=\"https:\/\/support.kraken.com\/hc\/en-us\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Support Center<\/a> immediately<\/strong><br><\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Stay informed about best practices for account and asset security through our<a href=\"https:\/\/www.kraken.com\/learn\/how-to-safely-send-receive-cryptocurrency\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"> Crypto Safety Guide<\/a><\/strong><br><\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Avoid enabling or interacting with potentially fraudulent behavior<\/strong><br><\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Use Kraken only for legitimate, lawful purposes<\/strong><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">By working together, you help protect not only yourself but the broader community.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-together-we-build-a-better-crypto-world\"><strong>Together, we build a better crypto world<\/strong><\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">We firmly believe that trust is essential for crypto to thrive. Creating a secure and trustworthy digital asset ecosystem is only possible through collective responsibility. Our compliance and security teams work around the clock to protect our platform and its users \u2013 but creating a secure environment takes all of us.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"width: 100%; height: auto; text-align: center;\"><a class=\"btn btn-primary\" style=\"display: inline-block; padding: 12px 32px; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold; text-align: center; text-decoration: none; transition: opacity 0.2s linear 0s; line-height: 24px; border-radius: 90px; color: #FFFFFF; background-color: #5D45DC; border: 1px solid #5D45DC;\" href=\"https:\/\/www.kraken.com\/sign-up\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Get Started with Kraken<\/a><\/div>\n<div>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>We are committed to maintaining the highest standards of trust, security and integrity. We do this to protect our clients while advancing our mission to accelerate the global adoption of crypto. We take our responsibility seriously, which is why preventing bad actors from using our platform is a key part of our efforts. Our approach: [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":230089386,"featured_media":28271,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"_jetpack_newsletter_access":"","_jetpack_dont_email_post_to_subs":false,"_jetpack_newsletter_tier_id":0,"_jetpack_memberships_contains_paywalled_content":false,"_wpcom_ai_launchpad_first_post":false,"_jetpack_feature_clip_id":0,"_jetpack_memberships_contains_paid_content":false,"footnotes":"","jetpack_post_was_ever_published":false},"categories":[1783],"tags":[1394,1373,1403,1409],"language":[],"class_list":["post-28744","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","category-industry-news","tag-compliance","tag-featured","tag-kraken","tag-security"],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO Premium plugin v23.2 (Yoast SEO v28.5) - https:\/\/yoast.com\/product\/yoast-seo-premium-wordpress\/ -->\n<title>Keeping our platform safe: How we protect against fraud and criminal activity - Kraken Blog<\/title>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\" \/>\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/news\/industry-news\/keeping-our-platform-safe\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Keeping our platform safe: How we protect against fraud and criminal activity\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"We are committed to maintaining the highest standards of trust, security and integrity. We do this to protect our clients while advancing our mission to accelerate the global adoption of crypto. We take our responsibility seriously, which is why preventing bad actors from using our platform is a key part of our efforts. Our approach: [&hellip;]\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/news\/industry-news\/keeping-our-platform-safe\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"Kraken Blog\" \/>\n<meta property=\"article:published_time\" content=\"2025-06-11T13:25:33+00:00\" \/>\n<meta property=\"article:modified_time\" content=\"2025-06-17T11:07:19+00:00\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/3070x1400.png\" \/>\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"3070\" \/>\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"1400\" \/>\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:type\" content=\"image\/png\" \/>\n<meta name=\"author\" content=\"KrakenFX\" \/>\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\" \/>\n<meta name=\"twitter:label1\" content=\"Written by\" \/>\n\t<meta name=\"twitter:data1\" content=\"KrakenFX\" \/>\n\t<meta name=\"twitter:label2\" content=\"Est. reading time\" \/>\n\t<meta name=\"twitter:data2\" content=\"3 minutes\" \/>\n<script type=\"application\/ld+json\" class=\"yoast-schema-graph\">{\"@context\":\"https:\\\/\\\/schema.org\",\"@graph\":[{\"@type\":\"Article\",\"@id\":\"https:\\\/\\\/blog.kraken.com\\\/news\\\/industry-news\\\/keeping-our-platform-safe#article\",\"isPartOf\":{\"@id\":\"https:\\\/\\\/blog.kraken.com\\\/news\\\/industry-news\\\/keeping-our-platform-safe\"},\"author\":{\"name\":\"KrakenFX\",\"@id\":\"https:\\\/\\\/blog.kraken.com\\\/#\\\/schema\\\/person\\\/87e55a5e8ea020a6e620192589a05abf\"},\"headline\":\"Keeping our platform safe: How we protect against fraud and criminal activity\",\"datePublished\":\"2025-06-11T13:25:33+00:00\",\"dateModified\":\"2025-06-17T11:07:19+00:00\",\"mainEntityOfPage\":{\"@id\":\"https:\\\/\\\/blog.kraken.com\\\/news\\\/industry-news\\\/keeping-our-platform-safe\"},\"wordCount\":459,\"commentCount\":0,\"publisher\":{\"@id\":\"https:\\\/\\\/blog.kraken.com\\\/#organization\"},\"image\":{\"@id\":\"https:\\\/\\\/blog.kraken.com\\\/news\\\/industry-news\\\/keeping-our-platform-safe#primaryimage\"},\"thumbnailUrl\":\"https:\\\/\\\/i0.wp.com\\\/blog.kraken.com\\\/wp-content\\\/uploads\\\/2025\\\/05\\\/3070x1400.png?fit=3070%2C1400&ssl=1\",\"keywords\":[\"compliance\",\"featured\",\"Kraken\",\"security\"],\"articleSection\":[\"Industry News\"],\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\",\"potentialAction\":[{\"@type\":\"CommentAction\",\"name\":\"Comment\",\"target\":[\"https:\\\/\\\/blog.kraken.com\\\/news\\\/industry-news\\\/keeping-our-platform-safe#respond\"]}]},{\"@type\":\"WebPage\",\"@id\":\"https:\\\/\\\/blog.kraken.com\\\/news\\\/industry-news\\\/keeping-our-platform-safe\",\"url\":\"https:\\\/\\\/blog.kraken.com\\\/news\\\/industry-news\\\/keeping-our-platform-safe\",\"name\":\"Keeping our platform safe: How we protect against fraud and criminal activity - Kraken Blog\",\"isPartOf\":{\"@id\":\"https:\\\/\\\/blog.kraken.com\\\/#website\"},\"primaryImageOfPage\":{\"@id\":\"https:\\\/\\\/blog.kraken.com\\\/news\\\/industry-news\\\/keeping-our-platform-safe#primaryimage\"},\"image\":{\"@id\":\"https:\\\/\\\/blog.kraken.com\\\/news\\\/industry-news\\\/keeping-our-platform-safe#primaryimage\"},\"thumbnailUrl\":\"https:\\\/\\\/i0.wp.com\\\/blog.kraken.com\\\/wp-content\\\/uploads\\\/2025\\\/05\\\/3070x1400.png?fit=3070%2C1400&ssl=1\",\"datePublished\":\"2025-06-11T13:25:33+00:00\",\"dateModified\":\"2025-06