tion":[{"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/230089386"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=28747"}],"version-history":[{"count":11,"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/28747\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":28781,"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/28747\/revisions\/28781"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/28773"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=28747"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"category","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/categories?post=28747"},{"taxonomy":"post_tag","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/tags?post=28747"},{"taxonomy":"language","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/language?post=28747"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}},{"id":28753,"date":"2025-06-17T09:00:03","date_gmt":"2025-06-17T13:00:03","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/?p=28753"},"modified":"2025-07-17T12:05:27","modified_gmt":"2025-07-17T16:05:27","slug":"kraken-app-and-web","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/product\/bonded-earn\/kraken-app-and-web","title":{"rendered":"Earn more with Bonded Earn: Now live in the Kraken app and on Kraken web"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><a href=\"https:\/\/k.k.xyz\/JDNW\/aqurccqw\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Bonded Earn<\/a> is now available directly in the Kraken app and on the web, giving you access to higher reward potential by temporarily committing your crypto for a set period. It\u2019s a simple, guided way to grow your holdings faster, while staying fully informed every step of the way.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-what-is-bonded-earn\"><strong>What is Bonded Earn?<\/strong><\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Bonded Earn, including bonded staking and bonded Opt-In Rewards (OIR), allow you to <strong>lock your crypto for a defined time in exchange for better returns<\/strong>. Unlike flexible Earn options or our <a href=\"https:\/\/support.kraken.com\/articles\/overview-of-auto-earn-on-kraken\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Auto Earn<\/a> feature, which let you withdraw anytime with lower rewards, Bonded Earn rewards your commitment with <strong>higher, more powerful compounding potential<\/strong>.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">And now, it\u2019s all available in the Kraken app and on Kraken web; no advanced tools, no complexity, no Pro account required.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-why-go-bonded\"><strong>Why go Bonded?<\/strong><\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Sometimes, a little commitment goes a long way. Bonded Earn is built for users who want more from their crypto without giving up visibility or control.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">\ud83d\udd12 <strong>Boost your rewards<br><\/strong> Choose from select assets and lock them for a short period to access elevated reward rates.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">\ud83d\udcc5 <strong>Know exactly what to expect<br><\/strong> From bonding to unbonding, we\u2019ll show you clear timelines up front and notify you when your assets are available again.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">\ud83d\udcf2 <strong>Track it all in one place<br><\/strong> Monitor what\u2019s bonded, what\u2019s earning and what\u2019s ready to withdraw \u2013 all from your Kraken portfolio.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-what-assets-are-available\"><strong>What assets are available?<\/strong><\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">We\u2019re continuously expanding our list of supported assets for Bonded Earn. Currently, you can use Bonded Earn with ALGO, ATOM, DOT, DYM, ETH, ETH Restaking,&nbsp;FLOW, FLOWH, FLR, GRT, INJ, KAVA, KSM, MINAl, POL, SCRT, SEI, SOL, TRX, TAO, TIA and XTZ (availability varies by region).<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">More bonded opportunities will roll out regularly, and they\u2019ll all be accessible directly from <a href=\"https:\/\/k.k.xyz\/JDNW\/aqurccqw\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">the Earn tab in your app<\/a> and on Kraken web.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-plan-ahead-earn-smarter\"><strong>Plan ahead. Earn smarter.<\/strong><\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The new Bonded Earn experience includes tools to help you get more out of every crypto move:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>See your potential<\/strong><strong><br><\/strong>Explore different reward scenarios and visualize how compounding could help grow your holdings over time.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Stay in the loop<\/strong><strong><br><\/strong>Get timely reminders when rewards are paid, and alerts when your unbonding period is complete, so you\u2019re always in control.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>No surprises, just strategy<\/strong><strong><br><\/strong>Every action comes with clear explanations, timelines and access points so you\u2019ll never wonder where your funds are or when they\u2019ll be available.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Now available in the Kraken app <em>and<\/em> Kraken Pro<\/strong><br>Bonded strategies were once exclusive to Kraken Pro users. Now they\u2019re available for everyone in the Kraken app and on Kraken web &#8212; the same powerful benefits, all packaged in a simple, transparent experience built for all levels of crypto users.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">So whether you\u2019re just starting out or optimizing a portfolio, Bonded Earn helps you confidently take that next step.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-get-started-with-bonded-earn-today\"><strong>Get started with Bonded Earn today<\/strong><\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Open the Kraken app and head to the Earn tab. Or log in to Kraken web. Choose your preferred asset, explore your options and bond with confidence.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Earn more. Stay in control. Welcome to smarter crypto rewards.<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"width: 100%; height: auto; text-align: center;\"><a class=\"btn btn-primary\" style=\"display: inline-block; padding: 12px 32px; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold; text-align: center; text-decoration: none; transition: opacity 0.2s linear 0s; line-height: 24px; border-radius: 90px; color: #FFFFFF; background-color: #5D45DC; border: 1px solid #5D45DC;\" href=\"https:\/\/k.k.xyz\/JDNW\/aqurccqw\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Explore Bonded Earn<\/a><\/div>\n<div>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><em>Geographic restrictions apply. Projected annual rate is an estimate based on the average staking rewards accrued over the past period, before commission, and is subject to change.&nbsp; Staking involves risks including no guarantee of rewards, potential loss from slashing or hacks, and depreciation in the value of assets while staked. Please refer to Kraken&#8217;s<a href=\"https:\/\/www.kraken.com\/legal\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"> Terms of Service<\/a> for additional information.<\/em><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><em>Opt-In Rewards Program not available in the U.S. and other geographic restrictions apply. Reward rates are subject to change. Participation in the Opt-In Rewards Program involves an element of risk and may not be suitable for everyone. For the full terms and conditions, please refer to\u00a0<a href=\"https:\/\/www.kraken.com\/legal\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Kraken\u2019s Terms of Service<\/a>.<\/em><\/p>\n\n\n\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote is-layout-flow wp-block-quote-is-layout-flow\">\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><\/p>\n<\/blockquote>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p><i>Higher rewards. Clear timelines. Full control. Why settle for flexible when you can go further?<\/i><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":230089386,"featured_media":28755,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"_jetpack_newsletter_access":"","_jetpack_dont_email_post_to_subs":false,"_jetpack_newsletter_tier_id":0,"_jetpack_memberships_contains_paywalled_content":false,"_wpcom_ai_launchpad_first_post":false,"_jetpack_feature_clip_id":0,"_jetpack_memberships_contains_paid_content":false,"footnotes":"","jetpack_post_was_ever_published":false},"categories":[1942,1426],"tags":[1943,1373,1443],"language":[],"class_list":["post-28753","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","category-bonded-earn","category-product","tag-bonded-earn","tag-featured","tag-staking"],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO Premium plugin v23.2 (Yoast SEO v28.5) - https:\/\/yoast.com\/product\/yoast-seo-premium-wordpress\/ -->\n<title>Earn more with Bonded Earn: Now live in the Kraken app and on Kraken web - Kraken Blog<\/title>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\" \/>\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/product\/bonded-earn\/kraken-app-and-web\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Earn more with Bonded Earn: Now live in the Kraken app and on Kraken web\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Higher rewards. Clear timelines. Full control. Why settle for flexible when you can go further?\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/product\/bonded-earn\/kraken-app-and-web\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"Kraken Blog\" \/>\n<meta property=\"article:published_time\" content=\"2025-06-17T13:00:03+00:00\" \/>\n<meta property=\"article:modified_time\" content=\"2025-07-17T16:05:27+00:00\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/BondedStaking_Blog_1535x700@2x-1024x467.png\" \/>\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"1024\" \/>\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"467\" \/>\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:type\" content=\"image\/png\" \/>\n<meta name=\"author\" content=\"KrakenFX\" \/>\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\" \/>\n<meta name=\"twitter:label1\" content=\"Written by\" \/>\n\t<meta name=\"twitter:data1\" content=\"KrakenFX\" \/>\n\t<meta name=\"twitter:label2\" content=\"Est. reading time\" \/>\n\t<meta name=\"twitter:data2\" content=\"3 minutes\" \/>\n<script type=\"application\/ld+json\" class=\"yoast-schema-graph\">{\"@context\":\"https:\\\/\\\/schema.org\",\"@graph\":[{\"@type\":\"Article\",\"@id\":\"https:\\\/\\\/blog.kraken.com\\\/product\\\/bonded-earn\\\/kraken-app-and-web#article\",\"isPartOf\":{\"@id\":\"https:\\\/\\\/blog.kraken.com\\\/product\\\/bonded-earn\\\/kraken-app-and-web\"},\"author\":{\"name\":\"KrakenFX\",\"@id\":\"https:\\\/\\\/blog.kraken.com\\\/#\\\/schema\\\/person\\\/87e55a5e8ea020a6e620192589a05abf\"},\"headline\":\"Earn more with Bonded Earn: Now live in the Kraken app and on Kraken web\",\"datePublished\":\"2025-06-17T13:00:03+00:00\",\"dateModified\":\"2025-07-17T16:05:27+00:00\",\"mainEntityOfPage\":{\"@id\":\"https:\\\/\\\/blog.kraken.com\\\/product\\\/bonded-earn\\\/kraken-app-and-web\"},\"wordCount\":644,\"commentCount\":0,\"publisher\":{\"@id\":\"https:\\\/\\\/blog.kraken.com\\\/#org