},{"@type":"Organization","@id":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/#organization","name":"Kraken Blog","url":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","inLanguage":"en-US","@id":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/#\/schema\/logo\/image\/","url":"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/06\/New-Lockups%402x.png?fit=214%2C64&ssl=1","contentUrl":"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/06\/New-Lockups%402x.png?fit=214%2C64&ssl=1","width":214,"height":64,"caption":"Kraken Blog"},"image":{"@id":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/#\/schema\/logo\/image\/"}},{"@type":"Person","@id":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/#\/schema\/person\/87e55a5e8ea020a6e620192589a05abf","name":"KrakenFX","image":{"@type":"ImageObject","inLanguage":"en-US","@id":"https:\/\/secure.gravatar.com\/avatar\/376cf5127aff2ae0a43942a0566f9d379956601670650244112b4fdb4b8c31e3?s=96&d=identicon&r=g","url":"https:\/\/secure.gravatar.com\/avatar\/376cf5127aff2ae0a43942a0566f9d379956601670650244112b4fdb4b8c31e3?s=96&d=identicon&r=g","contentUrl":"https:\/\/secure.gravatar.com\/avatar\/376cf5127aff2ae0a43942a0566f9d379956601670650244112b4fdb4b8c31e3?s=96&d=identicon&r=g","caption":"KrakenFX"},"url":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/author\/alex-hatch"}]}},"jetpack_likes_enabled":false,"jetpack_sharing_enabled":true,"jetpack_shortlink":"https:\/\/wp.me\/peDd1v-7uS","jetpack_featured_media_url":"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/wyoming-3070-1400.png?fit=3070%2C1400&ssl=1","_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/28822","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/230089386"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=28822"}],"version-history":[{"count":11,"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/28822\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":29024,"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/28822\/revisions\/29024"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/28831"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=28822"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"category","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/categories?post=28822"},{"taxonomy":"post_tag","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/tags?post=28822"},{"taxonomy":"language","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/language?post=28822"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}},{"id":28864,"date":"2025-06-25T08:41:42","date_gmt":"2025-06-25T12:41:42","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/?p=28864"},"modified":"2025-06-25T15:36:00","modified_gmt":"2025-06-25T19:36:00","slug":"how-to-trade-all-time-highs-with-dentoshi","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/crypto-education\/how-to-trade-all-time-highs-with-dentoshi","title":{"rendered":"Riding the breakout: How to trade assets making new all-time highs with Dentoshi"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The crypto market has a reputation for being fast-moving and volatile \u2013 but when assets begin testing and breaking new all-time highs (ATHs), traders face some of the most critical decisions of their careers. In <a href=\"https:\/\/x.com\/i\/spaces\/1OwxWXWlNXkKQ\">a recent Twitter\/X Spaces session<\/a> hosted by Kraken VP Growth Matt Howells-Barby, veteran trader <a href=\"https:\/\/x.com\/Dentoshi\">@<strong>Dentoshi<\/strong><\/a> unpacked the mindset, tools and strategies she uses to navigate those conditions.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><a href=\"https:\/\/x.com\/Dentoshi\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\" noreferrer noopener\"><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"890\" height=\"562\" data-attachment-id=\"28867\" data-permalink=\"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/crypto-education\/how-to-trade-all-time-highs-with-dentoshi\/attachment\/dentoshiprofile\" data-orig-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/DentoshiProfile.png?fit=890%2C562&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"890,562\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-meta=\"{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}\" data-image-title=\"DentoshiProfile\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/DentoshiProfile.png?fit=890%2C562&amp;ssl=1\" src=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/DentoshiProfile.png?resize=890%2C562&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-28867\" srcset=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/DentoshiProfile.png?w=890&amp;ssl=1 890w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/DentoshiProfile.png?resize=300%2C189&amp;ssl=1 300w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/DentoshiProfile.png?resize=768%2C485&amp;ssl=1 768w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/DentoshiProfile.png?resize=158%2C100&amp;ssl=1 158w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 890px) 100vw, 890px\" \/><\/a><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Whether you\u2019re a trend trader, a meme coin speculator or someone sitting on the sidelines wondering when to act, Dentoshi explains strategies and tactics for managing risk and riding momentum without falling into emotional traps.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-trading-the-all-time-high-break\"><strong>Trading the all-time high break<\/strong><\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">When Bitcoin <strong>hit a new ATH on May 22<\/strong>, the reaction was brief but euphoric. For Dentoshi, whose BTC holdings are largely in <a href=\"https:\/\/www.kraken.com\/learn\/what-is-crypto-hardware-wallet\">cold storage<\/a>, the moment was more of a signal to watch \u201c<em>what comes next<\/em> \u2013 <em>especially<\/em> <em>for altcoins<\/em>.\u201d<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">History suggests that after BTC sets an ATH, a rotation into alts often follows. But there are a few things we need to see on the charts for this to happen, like a drop in Bitcoin dominance (BTC.D) and <a href=\"https:\/\/pro.kraken.com\/app\/trade\/eth-btc\">ETH\/BTC strength<\/a>, but these things have not happened yet. Dentoshi cautions: \u201c<strong>This cycle is different<\/strong>.\u201d<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center wp-block-paragraph\"><em>\u201cInstitutional capital is in the game now, and much of it enters via ETFs \u2013 not onchain or through altcoin speculation. That changes the liquidity dynamics.\u201d<\/em><\/p>\n\n\n\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet\"><p lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">Trading with <a href=\"https:\/\/twitter.com\/krakenpro?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw\">@KrakenPro<\/a> on the go \ud83e\udd1d <a href=\"https:\/\/twitter.com\/Dentoshi?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw\">@Dentoshi<\/a> <a href=\"https:\/\/t.co\/k5j1VsHC9R\">pic.twitter.com\/k5j1VsHC9R<\/a><\/p>&mdash; Kraken Exchange (@krakenfx) <a href=\"https:\/\/twitter.com\/krakenfx\/status\/1858524523563278385?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw\">November 18, 2024<\/a><\/blockquote> <script async src=\"https:\/\/platform.twitter.com\/widgets.js\" charset=\"utf-8\"><\/script>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Trading the chop: Knowing when to step back<\/strong><\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">One of the session\u2019s recurring themes was the importance of <strong>understanding market conditions<\/strong>. In sideways, choppy markets \u2013 like much of early 2025 \u2013 Dentoshi scales down activity significantly.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center wp-block-paragraph\"><em>\u201cSometimes you can be right about the level but wrong about the timing.\u201d<\/em><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Instead of trying to catch every bounce, Dentoshi waits for <strong>confirmation of trend shifts<\/strong>, especially via <a href=\"https:\/\/pro.kraken.com\/app\/trade\/eth-btc#dialog\/indicators\/exponential-moving-average\">EMAs (exponential moving averages)<\/a> analysis.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https:\/\/pro.kraken.com\/app\/trade\/btc-usd#dialog\/indicators\/exponential-moving-average\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\" noreferrer noopener\"><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"468\" data-attachment-id=\"28873\" data-permalink=\"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/crypto-education\/how-to-trade-all-time-highs-with-dentoshi\/attachment\/emakrakenpro\" data-orig-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/EMAKrakenPro.png?fit=3594%2C1642&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"3594,1642\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-meta=\"{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}\" data-image-title=\"EMAKrakenPro\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/EMAKrakenPro.png?fit=1024%2C468&amp;ssl=1\" src=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/EMAKrakenPro.png?resize=1024%2C468&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-28873\" srcset=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/EMAKrakenPro.png?resize=1024%2C468&amp;ssl=1 1024w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/EMAKrakenPro.png?resize=300%2C137&amp;ssl=1 300w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/EMAKrakenPro.png?resize=768%2C351&amp;ssl=1 768w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/EMAKrakenPro.png?resize=1536%2C702&amp;ssl=1 1536w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/EMAKrakenPro.png?resize=2048%2C936&amp;ssl=1 2048w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/EMAKrakenPro.png?resize=1200%2C548&amp;ssl=1 1200w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/EMAKrakenPro.png?resize=200%2C91&amp;ssl=1 200w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/EMAKrakenPro.png?w=3000&amp;ssl=1 3000w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1000px) 100vw, 1000px\" \/><\/a><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Position sizing and the art of timing<\/strong><\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Dentoshi referenced a famous tweet by pseudonymous trader GCR that sums up her key philosophy:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet\"><p lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">&quot;During altcoin cycles, you should maximize risk at the the beginning, and slowly reduce it over time, but most people do the opposite&quot;.<br><br>-GCR<\/p>&mdash; Route 2 FI (@Route2FI) <a href=\"https:\/\/twitter.com\/Route2FI\/status\/1856112573944406374?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw\">November 11, 2024<\/a><\/blockquote> <script async src=\"https:\/\/platform.twitter.com\/widgets.js\" charset=\"utf-8\"><\/script>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center wp-block-paragraph\"><em>\u201cToo many traders do the opposite: Hesitate during the early breakout, then go all-in near the top.\u201d <\/em><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Dentoshi warns against behavior that leads to this result: how <strong>greed often grows alongside market confidence<\/strong>, leading to poor entries late in the move.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center wp-block-paragraph\"><em>\u201cBe realistic about targets, manage expectations during consolidation, and take profits without blindly rotating gains into new positions.\u201d<\/em><\/p>\n\n\n\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet\"><p lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">Manage risk in the bull run with trailing stops on <a href=\"https:\/\/twitter.com\/krakenpro?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw\">@KrakenPro<\/a> \ud83e\udd1d <br><br>Learn how <a href=\"https:\/\/twitter.com\/Dentoshi?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw\">@Dentoshi<\/a> uses them in combination with EMA chart analysis \ud83d\udc47 <a href=\"https:\/\/t.co\/WgBslCnuC7\">pic.twitter.com\/WgBslCnuC7<\/a><\/p>&mdash; Kraken Exchange (@krakenfx) <a href=\"https:\/\/twitter.com\/krakenfx\/status\/1860954149208113410?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw\">November 25, 2024<\/a><\/blockquote> <script async src=\"https:\/\/platform.twitter.com\/widgets.js\" charset=\"utf-8\"><\/script>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Tools of the trade: EMAs, dominance and narrative momentum<\/strong><\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">So how does she separate the false starts from the real trends? Dentoshi relies heavily on:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>EMAs<\/strong> for trend direction and exhaustion points<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>BTC and ETH dominance <\/strong>metrics<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Volume and <\/strong><a href=\"https:\/\/pro.kraken.com\/app\/trade\/btc-usd#dialog\/patterns\"><strong>chart patterns<\/strong><\/a><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Narrative momentum<\/strong>: If narratives rotate quickly and fail to stick, the market likely isn\u2019t ready for sustained altcoin rallies.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet\"><p lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\ud83d\udcfa Watch <a href=\"https:\/\/twitter.com\/Dentoshi?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw\">@Dentoshi<\/a> dive deep into Patterns:<br><br>\u25aa\ufe0f Breaking down flags and pennants like a Pro.<br>\u25aa\ufe0f Showing a classic bullish play.<br>\u25aa\ufe0f Setting a target price using Flagpoles.<br><br>That lady can draw \ud83d\udc69\u200d\ud83c\udfa8 <a href=\"https:\/\/t.co\/te30cYR1ru\">pic.twitter.com\/te30cYR1ru<\/a><\/p>&mdash; Kraken Pro (@krakenpro) <a href=\"https:\/\/twitter.com\/krakenpro\/status\/1910711528820482237?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw\">April 11, 2025<\/a><\/blockquote> <script async src=\"https:\/\/platform.twitter.com\/widgets.js\" charset=\"utf-8\"><\/script>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">In strong markets, <strong>trending narratives last longer<\/strong>. <a href=\"https:\/\/pro.kraken.com\/app\/markets\/crypto?categoryName=Meme+Coins\">Memecoins<\/a> can ride these waves when sentiment and volume align.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https:\/\/pro.kraken.com\/app\/markets\/crypto?categoryName=Meme+Coins\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\" noreferrer noopener\"><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"535\" data-attachment-id=\"28893\" data-permalink=\"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/crypto-education\/how-to-trade-all-time-highs-with-dentoshi\/attachment\/screenshot-2025-06-25-at-13-50-21-2\" data-orig-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/Screenshot-2025-06-25-at-13.50.21-2.png?fit=3592%2C1878&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"3592,1878\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-meta=\"{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}\" data-image-title=\"Screenshot 2025-06-25 at 13.50.21 (2)\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/Screenshot-2025-06-25-at-13.50.21-2.png?fit=1024%2C535&amp;ssl=1\" src=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/Screenshot-2025-06-25-at-13.50.21-2.png?resize=1024%2C535&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-28893\" srcset=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/Screenshot-2025-06-25-at-13.50.21-2.png?resize=1024%2C535&amp;ssl=1 1024w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/Screenshot-2025-06-25-at-13.50.21-2.png?resize=300%2C157&amp;ssl=1 300w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/Screenshot-2025-06-25-at-13.50.21-2.png?resize=768%2C402&amp;ssl=1 768w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/Screenshot-2025-06-25-at-13.50.21-2.png?resize=1536%2C803&amp;ssl=1 1536w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/Screenshot-2025-06-25-at-13.50.21-2.png?resize=2048%2C1071&amp;ssl=1 2048w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/Screenshot-2025-06-25-at-13.50.21-2.png?resize=1200%2C627&amp;ssl=1 1200w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/Screenshot-2025-06-25-at-13.50.21-2.png?resize=191%2C100&amp;ssl=1 191w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/Screenshot-2025-06-25-at-13.50.21-2.png?w=3000&amp;ssl=1 3000w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1000px) 100vw, 1000px\" \/><\/a><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Journaling, focus and staying sane<\/strong><\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Dentoshi is adamant about mental hygiene. She journals trades (ideally 2\u20133 times per week), sets <strong>clear entry\/exit rules<\/strong>, and tunes out Twitter noise by following a curated list of serious traders.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">She also emphasizes the need for <strong>low-dopamine hobbies<\/strong> \u2013 activities that help break the constant feedback loop of screen-watching and FOMO.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">\u201cHave a plan, not a prediction,\u201d she said. \u201cThere are no safe entry points; only safe strategies.\u201d<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>What\u2019s next: Summer slowdown or altcoin renaissance?<\/strong><\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">With ETH in a tight 25-day range and Bitcoin hanging between key EMA levels, Dentoshi is watching for signs of breakout strength. Until then, her playbook remains cautious:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Mark key levels<\/strong><\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Set <\/strong><a href=\"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/product\/now-live-price-alerts-on-kraken-pro\"><strong>price alerts<\/strong><\/a><\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Wait for volume and trend confirmation<\/strong><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">If ETH breaks out, we could see an altcoin resurgence. If not, a long, slow summer could be on the horizon.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet\"><p lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">Price alerts on <a href=\"https:\/\/twitter.com\/krakenpro?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw\">@KrakenPro<\/a> \ud83d\udd14<br><br>\ud83d\udd18 Enabled <a href=\"https:\/\/t.co\/aRJF10On2o\">https:\/\/t.co\/aRJF10On2o<\/a><\/p>&mdash; Kraken Exchange (@krakenfx) <a href=\"https:\/\/twitter.com\/krakenfx\/status\/1775135846850502804?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw\">April 2, 2024<\/a><\/blockquote> <script async src=\"https:\/\/platform.twitter.com\/widgets.js\" charset=\"utf-8\"><\/script>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Trading ATHs: Final thoughts<\/strong><\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Trading ATH breakouts requires more than guts. It demands discipline, a clear system and an ability to avoid noise. Dentoshi\u2019s thoughtful, no-nonsense approach serves as a roadmap for anyone trying to catch the <em>meat of the move<\/em> without losing their mind (or their portfolio). For more from Dentoshi, check out her EMA trading series in collaboration with Kraken Pro and follow her on<a href=\"https:\/\/twitter.com\/dentoshi\"> X\/Twitter<\/a> for live chart updates and insights.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"width: 100%; height: auto; text-align: center;\"><a class=\"btn btn-primary\" style=\"display: inline-block; padding: 12px 32px; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold; text-align: center; text-decoration: none; transition: opacity 0.2s linear 0s; line-height: 24px; border-radius: 90px; color: #FFFFFF; background-color: #5D45DC; border: 1px solid #5D45DC;\" href=\"https:\/\/kraken.pxf.io\/c\/5984839\/1589189\/10583\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Trade with Dentoshi on Kraken Pro<\/a><\/div>\n<div>\n\n\n\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet\"><p lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">THE (E)MA SERIES.<br><br>A new video series, where I share insights in my entire thought process when it comes to trading (E)MA&#39;s. <br><br>Part 1: Defining Trend \ud83d\udcc8 <a href=\"https:\/\/t.co\/Gb0BHXyeEE\">pic.twitter.com\/Gb0BHXyeEE<\/a><\/p>&mdash; Dentoshi (@Dentoshi) <a href=\"https:\/\/twitter.com\/Dentoshi\/status\/1704129313262744057?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw\">September 19, 2023<\/a><\/blockquote> <script async src=\"https:\/\/platform.twitter.com\/widgets.js\" charset=\"utf-8\"><\/script>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><em>The views and opinions expressed in this article are those of the author and do not necessarily represent the views or opinions of Kraken or its management.<\/em><\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>The crypto market has a reputation for being fast-moving and volatile \u2013 but when assets begin testing and breaking new all-time highs (ATHs), traders face some of the most critical decisions of their careers. In a recent Twitter\/X Spaces session hosted by Kraken VP Growth Matt Howells-Barby, veteran trader @Dentoshi unpacked the mindset, tools and [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":230089386,"featured_media":28865,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"_jetpack_newsletter_access":"","_jetpack_dont_email_post_to_subs":false,"_jetpack_newsletter_tier_id":0,"_jetpack_memberships_contains_paywalled_content":false,"_wpcom_ai_launchpad_first_post":false,"_jetpack_feature_clip_id":0,"_jetpack_memberships_contains_paid_content":false,"footnotes":"","jetpack_post_was_ever_published":false},"categories":[1391],"tags":[1946,1373,1722,1476],"language":[],"class_list":["post-28864","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","category-crypto-education","tag-dentoshi","tag-featured","tag-kraken-pro","tag-trading"],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO Premium plugin v23.2 (Yoast SEO v28.5) - https:\/\/yoast.com\/product\/yoast-seo-premium-wordpress\/ -->\n<title>Riding the breakout: How to trade assets making new all-time highs with Dentoshi - Kraken Blog<\/title>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\" \/>\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/crypto-education\/how-to-trade-all-time-highs-with-dentoshi\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Riding the breakout: How to trade assets making new all-time highs with Dentoshi\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"The crypto market has a reputation for being fast-moving and volatile \u2013 but when assets begin testing and breaking new all-time highs (ATHs), traders face some of the most critical decisions of their careers. In a recent Twitter\/X Spaces session hosted by Kraken VP Growth Matt Howells-Barby, veteran trader @Dentoshi unpacked the mindset, tools and [&hellip;]\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/crypto-education\/how-to-trade-all-time-highs-with-dentoshi\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"Kraken Blog\" \/>\n<meta property=\"article:published_time\" content=\"2025-06-25T12:41:42+00:00\" \/>\n<meta property=\"article:modified_time\" content=\"2025-06-25T19:36:00+00:00\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/Dentoshi-X-Spaces.png\" \/>\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"3070\" \/>\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"1400\" \/>\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:type\" content=\"image\/png\" \/>\n<meta name=\"author\" content=\"KrakenFX\" \/>\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\" \/>\n<meta name=\"twitter:label1\" content=\"Written by\" \/>\n\t<meta name=\"twitter:data1\" content=\"KrakenFX\" \/>\n\t<meta name=\"twitter:label2\" content=\"Est. reading time\" \/>\n\t<meta name=\"twitter:data2\" content=\"4 minutes\" \/>\n<script type=\"application\/ld+json\" class=\"yoast-schema-graph\">{\"@context\":\"https:\\\/\\\/schema.org\",\"@graph\":[{\"@type\":\"Article\",\"@id\":\"https:\\\/\\\/blog.kraken.com\\\/crypto-education\\\/how-to-trade-all-time-highs-with-dentoshi#article\",\"isPartOf\":{\"@id\":\"https:\\\/\\\/blog.kraken.com\\\/crypto-education\\\/how-to-trade-all-time-highs-with-dentoshi\"},\"author\":{\"name\":\"KrakenFX\",\"@id\":\"https:\\\/\\\/blog.kraken.com\\\/#\\\/schema\\\/person\\\/87e55a5e8ea020a6e620192589a05abf\"},\"headline\":\"Riding the breakout: How to trade assets making new all-time highs with Dentoshi\",\"datePublished\":\"2025-06-25T12:41:42+00:00\",\"dateModified\":\"202