yL1Y2C8k3s7nXbYqKx4KN3ghyUX2Ib925devHePvXVioPe3HeUw%2FLYTUPHoCCbzLBZCjqy8VSF9VwqCYwX0%2FW2Uu8rBjOL22dTzaYi8QPt6DReb2K60JvXrhlPyqt1zFu5t8AwNVAewBRFdLPfe9LLPr3FBekrC2AuV1%2Bfd%2F%22\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Open this layout in Kraken Desktop<\/a><\/em><\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-what-is-markdown-and-why-should-traders-care\"><strong>What is Markdown \u2013 and why should traders care?<\/strong><\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Markdown is a lightweight markup language that converts plain-text shortcuts into clean, styled content. It\u2019s fast, widely adopted and (you guessed it) <em>trader-friendly<\/em>. Our new module supports:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"><table class=\"has-fixed-layout\"><tbody><tr><td><strong>Formatting<\/strong><\/td><td><strong>Syntax example<\/strong><\/td><td><strong>Result<\/strong><\/td><\/tr><tr><td><strong>Bold<\/strong><\/td><td>**bold**<\/td><td><strong>bold<\/strong><\/td><\/tr><tr><td><em>Italic<\/em><\/td><td>*italic*<\/td><td><em>italic<\/em><\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Headings<\/td><td># H1 ## H2<\/td><td>H1 \/ H2<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Bullet lists<\/td><td>&#8211; item<\/td><td>\u2022 item<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Numbered lists<\/td><td>1. item<\/td><td>1. item<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Links<\/td><td>[text](url)<\/td><td>text<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Images<\/td><td>![alt](url)<\/td><td>![ ]<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Blockquotes<\/td><td>&gt; quote<\/td><td>&gt; quote<\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center wp-block-paragraph\"><strong><em>Top Tip: <\/em><\/strong><em>Never used Markdown? <\/em><a href=\"https:\/\/commonmark.org\/help\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><em>This handy primer<\/em><\/a><em> will get you started<\/em><\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"658\" data-attachment-id=\"28616\" data-permalink=\"https:\/\/bl